  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b><size=+10>Objective</size></b>

    The objective of Pyramid is to
    clear all cards from the titular pyramid by pairing cards that have a combined
    total value of 13.


    <b><size=+10>Layout</size></b>

    <b>\u2022 The Pyramid:</b>
    28 cards dealt face-up in overlapping rows forming a pyramid shape. Only completely
    uncovered cards are available for play.

    <b>\u2022 Stock:</b> The face-down
    pile containing the remining 24 cards.

    <b>\u2022 Waste:</b> The face-up
    pile where cards drawn from the stock are placed until used.

    <b>\u2022 Discard:</b>
    The face-up pile where cards are placed once removed from play'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7953b3aff3010de47827554b597de01f, type: 2}
