  m_text: '<b><size=+10>How To Win</size></b>

    You win the game when all 28 cards
    forming the Pyramid have been cleared.


    <b><size=+10>Tips and Strategies</size></b>

    <b>\u2022
    Plan Around Overlapping Cards:</b> Always look at which cards are overlapping
    each other before making a pair. Prioritise removing cards that unlock multiple
    face-down or covered cards beneath them.

    <b>\u2022 Always pair with the
    Pyramid:</b> If you can pair cards in the Pyramid, do not pair them with the
    Waste. You should plan to ensure that you use the Waste as little as possible

    <b>\u2022
    Remove Kings immediately:</b> Kings do not match with anything and can be removed
    on their own. If Auto-Move Cards is enabled in Settings, this will be done for
    you.'
